41 :end-byte 42}\n1398: :yang.diagnostic/arguments {:name \"x\"}}\n1401:Messages are rendered from stable codes and arguments. Native ANTLR\n1463:this document does not silently replace its addressing scheme.\n1469:### Phase 0: SPI, ANTLR boundary, and stream pipeline\n1478:- Explicit compiler state, staged writes, replay identities, and\n1481:- A generic replacement for the REPL's closed language dispatcher.\n1503:- ANTLR parsing and explicit dialect profiles.\n1520:- The legacy Python frontend remains selectable until the replacement\n1642:    recovered through replay.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
